id: pm-gh1577
title: "GH-1577: make SDK create focus inheritance explicit and discoverable"
description: Reported programmatic create can inherit a saved interactive focus as parent when the caller omitted parent. Inspect the current public receipt and documented unset-parent opt-out before choosing compatibility-safe SDK defaults or explicit inheritance policy.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: agent-ux,"gh:1577",sdk
created_at: "2026-10-24T16:12:43.896Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T02:37:29.583Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-25T02:35:33.012Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-25T02:35:32.538Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "Reproduce public SDK creation in a sandbox with saved focus and explicit/omitted/unset parent controls; Define and document SDK focus inheritance policy without silently changing CLI convenience; Make applied ambient defaults and parent provenance discoverable through types/help/receipt; Verify importer-style Node/Bun consumers and CLI/MCP parity, including templates, tags, assignee and workflow defaults."
parent: pm-9rgaal
risk: medium
confidence: medium
resolution: "SDK/MCP create and plan creation ignore saved focus unless inheritFocus:true. CLI create and plan create preserve focused creation with explicit opt-in/out controls. Parent normalization and dependency edges stay in the shared create primitive; whole-item JSON remains item metadata and rejects unregistered policy fields before writes. Types, tool schemas, generated contracts, SDK snapshot, docs and focused regressions agree."
expected_result: Programmatic consumers create the hierarchy they declare; interactive create and plan keep documented focus convenience and explicit overrides.
actual_result: "Review regression failed before the fix because CLI plan create persisted no focused parent. Corrected focus/plan/structured-input/tool-contract suite passes all66 tests; both linked PM commands pass with recorded execution receipts. Full static pipeline and typecheck pass. Whole-item stdin JSON containing inheritFocus:false is rejected before mutation and the requested id remains absent. CLI default/positive/negative flags, parent none, explicit parent and typed SDK plan omitted/false/true controls pass against real temporary persistence. Initial implementation full suite passed11227 tests with3 skips and exact100/100/100/100 source coverage; revised-head hosted coverage and external review remain required before merge. Initial strict operational gate passed; healthy API/worker and empty physical queue with active consumer are independently observed. The fresh seven-day telemetry query and final post-merge observability verification remain pending independently of source acceptance."
affected_version: 2026.10.20
