notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T00:57:47.115Z","harness:codex","Design: the SDK-owned create primitive defaults inheritFocus to false; the typed client/MCP and direct scheduling APIs expose opt-in. The thin CLI sets its own true default and exposes explicit positive/negative controls. Parent, template parent and unset-parent precedence remain governed by existing validators. Package calendar command handlers explicitly preserve their previous convenience. The effective inherited parent is stored in the item and create event, with parent_source:focus retained on the full receipt. New public types/help/schema/contracts remain aligned; no private import or test-only production seam was added."
